<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Aludie takes stake in ladder company.</title>
<headline>Aludie takes stake in ladder company.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aluminium extrusion company Aludie Ltd said on Monday it acquired 10 percent of SA Ladder (Pty) Ltd.</p>
<p>Aludie is paying 100 rand for the stake and has agreed to advance 800,000 interest-free to SA Ladder as a shareholders' loan. Aludie has an option to acquire a further 15 percent at any time up to May 16, 1998.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
